        "title": "Add WebContainer env schema fields",
        "summary": "Added optional NEXT_PUBLIC_WEBCONTAINER_API_KEY and NEXT_PUBLIC_WEBCONTAINER_RUNTIME_ORIGIN to clientEnvSchema and clientProcessEnv in common/src/env-schema.ts. These fields enable WebContainer integration configuration. Scope limited to shared core environment schema.",
