      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The app can now be told how to talk to a WebContainer-based runtime, a technology that lets code run inside your browser. Two new optional settings were added to the shared configuration: one for an API key that authorizes the connection, and one for the web address where the runtime lives. Because these are optional and no other code in this change reads them yet, the feature is in place but does nothing until a later update wires it up.",
