      "facts": [
        "Passive stall detector: a turn produced no harness stream activity for the configured window. Telemetry ONLY, the turn is not aborted. Join to desktop.turn_completed to tell a recovered long-silent tool call from a real hang, i.e. whether an *acting* watchdog is worth building.",
        "Rare reliability signal, every stalled turn must be counted, never sampled."
      ],
