        "summary": "Removed `NEXT_PUBLIC_WEBCONTAINER_API_KEY` from `common/src/env-schema.ts`. The variable is no longer defined in `clientEnvSchema` or mapped in `clientProcessEnv`. This change affects only the shared core environment configuration.",
