      "eli5": {
        "text": "The app no longer passes along a secret key used to run code inside isolated containers directly in your browser. If you looked at the configuration that loads up when the app starts in a web page, that key field and its matching setup line have been removed, so any browser-based sandbox that depended on reading that specific key will no longer find it there. Who is affected today narrowed to teams actively relying on that browser-based sandbox path, since the shared startup configuration no longer exposes that key.",
