        "title": "Add Laguna S 2.1 God-mode route",
        "summary": "Poolside's Laguna S 2.1 (`poolside/laguna-s-2.1`) added as god-mode-only route. Tests Poolside direct OpenAI-compatible API before wider rollout. Registered in `FREEBUFF_ROOT_AGENT_IDS`, `FREEBUFF_WEB_GOD_ONLY_MODELS`, and `FREEBUFF_WEB_GOD_ONLY_MODEL_IDS` within `common/src/constants/free-agents.ts` and `freebuff-models.ts`. Marked `experimental: true` and `premium: true`.",
