      "eli5": {
        "text": "If you're on the verified YC founders plan (the 'god-mode' tier), the assistant can now run a new experimental model called DeepSeek 2.1 from DeepSeek, accessed directly through their OpenAI-compatible API instead of going through a middleman. You'd spot it as a new option labeled 'DeepSeek 2.1 / Direct via DeepSeek' that's hidden from the regular model picker and clearly marked as experimental. It's already live for that group today, not a public rollout, and it's the kind of behind-the-scenes plumbing that lets the team test a direct connection before deciding whether to open it up more widely.",
